# Story 28: Agent Control @@ (30s)
# Hook: Full lifecycle control with @@ -- activate, deactivate, and stop agents.
# Duration: 30s
# Source: story-28-agent-control.tape
#
# Voiceover script with timing cues.
# Format: [START --> END] narration text
# Each entry should be spoken within its time window.
# Gaps between entries are silent (viewer watches the demo).
#
# Total segments: 10

[00:00.0 --> 00:04.0]
Start rysh -- we'll explore agent lifecycle control.

[00:04.0 --> 00:06.0]
Double-press Escape to enter prompt mode.

[00:06.0 --> 00:10.0]
Spawn a simple helper agent.

[00:10.0 --> 00:13.0]
List agents -- helper is active and running.

[00:13.0 --> 00:16.0]
@@helper deactivate pauses the agent -- it stays in memory but won't process new prompts.

[00:16.0 --> 00:19.0]
List again -- status shows deactivated.

[00:19.0 --> 00:22.0]
@@helper activate brings it back online.

[00:22.0 --> 00:25.0]
@@helper stop terminates the agent entirely.

[00:25.0 --> 00:28.0]
List agents -- helper is gone. Stopped agents are removed.

[00:28.0 --> 00:30.0]
@@: deactivate, activate, stop -- full lifecycle control.

